   "sourceHash": "9385b5308cbd9917b81b0d89ada89d2bf6ec8f439bcd1e9a3f33cf9243255f10",
   "text": "Kairali – The Ayurvedic Healing Village 将正宗阿育吠陀与现代健康理念相结合，帮助深度排毒与焕活。我们的疗法——包括 Abhyangam（阿比扬伽，草药油按摩）、Shirodhara（希罗达拉，药油滴额疗法）和 Udvarthana（乌德瓦塔纳，草药粉按摩）——均采用园区内有机种植的纯天然原料。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d48a2465e0baf24e298f",
   "sourceHash": "d48a2465e0baf24e298f1a8d34aa200cb1d9c3258d1ac3b15fd8dbc4499d1fab",
